0..72 Comment "//! A rule that joins two constants: the terms of its theory are a type."
73..76 Comment "//!"
77..152 Comment "//! A type can state that two of its constants are one value. The rule that"
153..229 Comment "//! joins them removes no constructor. So the count of the constructors of a"
230..275 Comment "//! term does not show that the rewrites end."
276..279 Comment "//!"
280..357 Comment "//! The kernel orders the constructors by each rule that keeps the count. The"
358..436 Comment "//! root of the left side stands above each constructor of the right side, and"
437..516 Comment "//! no constructor stands above itself. Each such rewrite lowers a term in that"
517..592 Comment "//! order, so the rewrites end. Conversion at the type then compares normal"
593..603 Comment "//! forms."
604..607 Comment "//!"
608..624 Comment "//! - see: #8330"
626..638 Comment "// `Hollow`."
639..645 Keyword "import"
646..647 StringLit "\""
